Use a persistent bottom navigation bar on mobile and a suitable persistent navigation layout on desktop.

Include five destinations in this order:

1. Home
2. Cara.ai
3. Tools
4. Get Support
5. My Wellbeing

Use the following icons:
- Home: house
- Cara.ai: message-circle-heart
- Tools: compass
- Get Support: hand-heart
- My Wellbeing: chart or heart-pulse

Show a clear active state using sage green. Use icons with readable text labels; never rely on icons alone.

